{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SQ","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SH","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal"]]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/backEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/crossEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/discover(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/finish(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/forwardEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/treeEdge(_:)"],"title":"Enumeration Cases"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A vertex is discovered, then every edge out of it is reported once per copy, then it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finished. An edge to an undiscovered vertex is a tree edge, and the search continues from that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex before the next edge. An edge to a vertex discovered but not yet finished is a back","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edge; a self-loop is one. An edge to a finished vertex is a forward edge when that vertex was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"discovered later than the edge’s source (a descendant; a repeated tree edge is one), and a cross","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edge otherwise.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent"}],"symbolKind":"enum","externalID":"s:9Traversal21DepthFirstSearchEventO","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Traversal\/SearchEvents.swift#L25","fileName":"SearchEvents.swift"},"roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Traversal"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"What a depth-first search reports, in order, with the classification of CLRS §22.3.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/traversal\/depthfirstsearchevent"]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Traversal/s23CustomStringConvertibleP":{"title":"Swift.CustomStringConvertible","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traversal\